@startuml Full Application Sequence Diagram

title Full Application Sequence Diagram

' Define participants
actor User
participant "AuthController" as AC
participant "AdsController" as ADC
participant "CommentsController" as CC
participant "UsersController" as UC

participant "AuthService" as AS
participant "AdService" as ADS
participant "CommentService" as CS
participant "UserService" as US

participant "LoginMapper" as LM

database "Database" as DB
participant "File Storage" as FS

' ====== Authentication Flows ======
== Registration ==
User -> AC: POST /register (Register DTO)
AC -> AS: register(Register DTO)
AS -> DB: Check user existence
DB --> AS: User not found
AS -> DB: Create user
DB --> AS: User created
AS --> AC: true
AC -> User: 201 Created

== Login ==
User -> AC: POST /login (Login DTO)
AC -> LM: toDto(Login DTO)
LM --> AC: RegisterUserModel
AC -> AS: login(username, password)
AS -> DB: Verify credentials
DB --> AS: User data
AS --> AC: true (if authenticated)
AC -> User: 200 OK (with token)

' ====== User Management Flows ======
== Get User Info ==
User -> UC: GET /users/me
UC -> US: getInformationAboutUser()
US -> DB: Get user data
DB --> US: User data
US --> UC: User DTO
UC --> User: 200 OK, User DTO

== Update User Info ==
User -> UC: PATCH /users/me (UpdateUser)
UC -> US: updatingUserInformation(updateUser)
US -> DB: Update user data
DB --> US: Update confirmation
US --> UC: Updated UpdateUser DTO
UC --> User: 200 OK, Updated DTO

== Update User Avatar ==
User -> UC: PATCH /users/me/image (image)
UC -> US: updatingUsersAvatar(image)
US -> FS: Save image
FS --> US: Image URL
US -> DB: Update user's avatar URL
DB --> US: Update confirmation
US --> UC: 200 OK
UC --> User: 200 OK

' ====== Ad Management Flows ======
== Get All Ads ==
User -> ADC: GET /ads
ADC -> ADS: getAllService()
ADS -> DB: Get all ads
DB --> ADS: List of ads
ADS --> ADC: Ads DTO
ADC --> User: 200 OK, Ads DTO

== Create Ad ==
User -> ADC: POST /ads (parameters, image)
ADC -> ADS: addingAd(parameters, image)
ADS -> FS: Save image
FS --> ADS: Image URL
ADS -> DB: Create ad
DB --> ADS: Created ad
ADS --> ADC: 201 Created, Ad DTO
ADC --> User: 201 Created, Ad DTO

== Get Ad Details ==
User -> ADC: GET /ads/{id}
ADC -> ADS: getInformationAboutAd(id)
ADS -> DB: Get ad by ID
DB --> ADS: Ad data
ADS --> ADC: ExtendedAd DTO
ADC --> User: 200 OK, ExtendedAd DTO

' ====== Comment Management Flows ======
== Get Comments ==
User -> CC: GET /ads/{id}/comments
CC -> CS: getCommentsOnAd(id)
CS -> DB: Get comments by ad ID
DB --> CS: Comments list
CS --> CC: Comments DTO
CC --> User: 200 OK, Comments DTO

== Add Comment ==
User -> CC: POST /ads/{id}/comments (text)
CC -> CS: addCommentToAd(id, text)
CS -> DB: Create comment
DB --> CS: Created comment
CS --> CC: Comment DTO
CC --> User: 200 OK, Comment DTO

== Update Comment ==
User -> CC: PATCH /ads/{adId}/comments/{commentId}
CC -> CS: updatingComment(adId, commentId, updateData)
CS -> DB: Update comment
DB --> CS: Update confirmation
CS --> CC: Updated Comment DTO
CC --> User: 200 OK, Updated Comment DTO

== Delete Comment ==
User -> CC: DELETE /ads/{adId}/comments/{commentId}
CC -> CS: deleteCommentToAdId(adId, commentId)
CS -> DB: Delete comment
DB --> CS: Deletion confirmation
CS --> CC: 200 OK
CC --> User: 200 OK

@enduml
